    "body": "Stopped before opening a PR because local `cargo` builds are blocked on `sccache`.\n\nHeld work lives on branch `mkinney:issue/2065-theme-dropdown-metrics` at commit `e5a3c7a2`, stacked on `#2027`.\n\nBefore a final one-line lifetime fix on `crates/ui/src/egui_app/tests/dropdown_theme.rs` line 90 (`clippy::needless-lifetimes`), these checks passed:\n- `camcraft-ui --test theme_files`: 15 passed, 0 failed (`dropdown_tokens_parse_and_clamp`).\n- `camcraft-ui --lib machine_mode_tests`: 7 passed, 0 failed.\n- `camcraft-ui --lib dropdown_theme`: 2 passed, 0 failed (`narrow_window_clamps_dropdown_widths_to_stay_on_screen`, `all_dropdown_drawers_follow_theme_tokens`).\n- Five mutation checks ran RED when reverted and GREEN when restored across `theme_files/overlay.rs`, `DropGeom::fit_width`, `DropGeom::fit_left`, `DropGeom::from_tokens`, and `DropGeom::machine_width`.\n\nAfter that final test-file edit, `cargo clippy` and `cargo xtask gate quick` failed on every run with:\n`sccache: error: Connection to server timed out: Os { code: 111, kind: ConnectionRefused, message: \"Connection refused\" }`.\n\nReleasing `claimed` and `@me` so another worker can re-run `cargo clippy -p camcraft-ui --all-targets -- -D warnings` and `cargo xtask gate quick --base upstream/main` on commit `e5a3c7a2`.\n",
